hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-63 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-63 = cons "There is no canonical state and no privileged server owning the graph (§10.6, §10.8). Each participant holds its own local view over shared content-addressed objects; a peer receiving a construction does not trust the sender or an intermediary, but checks it locally against its own kernel. Web browsers, terminals, and file trees are merely boundary projections for legacy environments, not the ontology of the graph." (cons "" nil)
